                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Imagine shipping an unfinished game. Played through this with a friend on another platform and we were both incredibly disappointed by the absolute butchering of an ending. No closure, no fun final act, nothing - the game just boots you back to the map. There is no Battle of The Five Armies and the game doesn't even try to end on a good note.\n\nHonestly a huge disappointment given the new features added in the game.",
